<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see showers, cool weather.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see showers, cool weather.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Thursday were forecast to see showers and cool weather, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see cloudy skies and a 40 percent chance of showers with highs of 5 to 15 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see clouds and showers with highs of 5 to 18 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see clouds and showers with highs of 8 to 17 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
